Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nebula:=20Layer=20A=20@NebulaRW=20batch=2012=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=2030+=20entities=20reach=20DG2=20target?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds @NebulaRW annotations on tick/aiStep/customServerAiStep for:

Monsters: Slime, Silverfish, Endermite, Blaze, Witch, Vex, Phantom,
  Strider, Zoglin, Creeper, Spider, Zombie, ZombieVillager,
  Skeleton, EnderMan, Hoglin, Warden, Breeze, Ravager.

Animals: Animal, Sniffer, Bee, Fox, Dolphin, Sheep, Goat, Squid,
  Allay, Chicken, Frog, Wolf, Cat, Panda, IronGolem, SnowGolem,
  PolarBear, Parrot, Turtle.

Bosses & misc: WitherBoss, Bat, ArmorStand, Raider, Piglin.

Total annotation instances: 88 → 131 (DG2 target ≥130 met).

All annotations follow the established pattern: writeEntity(self.*)
+ readBlock(boundingBox.expand) + triggeredEvents{ENTITY_MOVED, ...}
+ maxRandomCalls in 4-8 range, with conservative SCC.AUTO.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ambient/Bat.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ambient/Bat.java
